  "body": "In most cases, this reserves it for long lists of \"tokens\", e.g. autocomplete tokens, DOCTYPE strings, tag names, or definitions in the references section.\n\nSome previous discussion in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9667#discussion_r1312677896.\n\nAlso contains various drive-by fixes to list markup and punctuation, including a few that were missed in be6c6659ab38d5552d0174175981b3bc62f908e3.\n\nCloses #9905 by superseding it (and also removing the class=brief).\n\nThe two commits might be best reviewed separately as the second is mechanical search-and-replace.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 1:19 AM UTC (2474e47)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/f406d8a...2474e47/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 1:19 AM UTC (2474e47)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 1:19 AM UTC (2474e47)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/f406d8a...2474e47/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 1:19 AM UTC (2474e47)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 1:19 AM UTC (2474e47)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/f406d8a...2474e47/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 1:19 AM UTC (2474e47)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10088/common-dom-interfaces.html\" tit